        "subset_size_units.descr": "<xdoc><p>Specifies whether the subset size value will be used as a percentage of the input features or as an absolute number of features.</p><ul><li><span title=\"PERCENTAGE_OF_INPUT\">Percentage of input</span>— The subset size will be used as a percentage of the input features that will be in the training dataset.</li><li><span title=\"ABSOLUTE_VALUE\">Absolute value</span>— The subset size will be used as the number of features that will be in the training dataset.</li></ul></xdoc>",
